@page "/legal/cookies"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Cookie policy";
}

<p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &raquo; <a href="/legal/terms">Legal</a> &raquo; Cookies</p>

<h1>Cookie policy</h1>

<p>The Meridian Portal uses a small number of cookies and similar local storage to keep the site working and to understand how it is used. This page explains what each one does.</p>

<table class="table">
    <thead>
        <tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>portal_session</td><td>Keeps you signed in while using the portal</td><td>Session</td></tr>
        <tr><td>consent_pref</td><td>Remembers your cookie preference so the banner is not shown again</td><td>12 months</td></tr>
        <tr><td>portal_analytics</td><td>Distinguishes returning visits for our first-party page-view counts</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<p>The <code>portal_session</code> cookie is required for the portal to function and cannot be turned off while remaining signed in. The <code>portal_analytics</code> cookie can be declined using the "Manage preferences" option on the consent banner shown on your first visit; declining it does not affect your ability to use the portal.</p>

<p>We do not use cookies from third-party advertising networks on this portal. For how the underlying data is otherwise handled, see our <a href="/legal/privacy">privacy notice</a>, or return to our <a href="/legal/terms">terms of use</a>.</p>
